   "title": "getByKey被ByKey规则优先推断致映射失效",
   "type": "bug",
   "content": "`getByKey` 被 `ByKey` 规则优先推断为 `key`，导致 `zhi2-web-admin/src/utils/apiV3Normalize.js` 中 `ACTION_PATH_PARAM_KEYS` 映射未生效。将 `getByKey: 'configKey'` 加入同文件优先级更高的 `ACTION_PARAM_KEY_OVERRIDES` 以修正请求体参数为 `{\"configKey\": \"...\"}`。",
